# Converted from the old Grade 2 Survex data (Grade2/Grade2/UpperRift.svx).

# > Ogof Draenen: Upper Rift, beyond pitch in Squirrel Rift
# 
# This data represents a fairly rough compass & tape survey with
# occasional estimated clino readings.
# 
# Survey conducted on Saturday 26th November by Morgannwg Caving Club.
# Survey: Andy Cave, Rick Blake, Ben Lovett.
# Data entry: Tim Long

survey ur

# Station Equivalences

# Specify units of measurement

# Magnetic North to Grid North correction
# Mag deviation at the time of the readings (9-Oct-94) was
# 4.2 degrees (data from OS sheet 161, 1991).

# Data ordering

# The survey data

survey pitchlink

# From   To      Dist    Brg     Clino   Comments

# There appears to be a pitch here which has NOT been surveyed properly -- TPL

centreline
  # BCRA2
  sd length 0.5 metres
  sd compass clino 2.5 degrees
  calibrate compass 4.2
  data normal from to length compass clino
  a	1	5.8	295	0	# V. Narrow rift
  1	2	3.3	295	0
  2	3	5.0	295	0
  3	4	2.3	305	0	# Breakthrough dig
  4	5	3.4	305	0	# Low
  5	6	2.8	305	-15	# Low
  6	7	14.7	300	0	# Walking
  7	z	3.6	300	0	# Station 16, Squirrel rift

endcentreline
endsurvey

survey upperrift

centreline
  # BCRA2
  sd length 0.5 metres
  sd compass clino 2.5 degrees
  calibrate compass 4.2
  data normal from to length compass clino
  1a	1	3.1	115	0	# Foot of pitch, aven inlet descends
  1	2	8.2	010	0	# Rift 20m high 2m wide
  2	3	4.5	010	0	# Cairn by junction (A)
  3	4	7.4	015	+45	# Silly climb
  4	5	12.1	015	0	# Cairn by junction (B)
  5	6	13.8	015	0	# Rift trverse above stream
  6	6a	10.0	030	-30	# Down to stream (tight but passable)
  6	7	3.9	350	+20	# Up (within same rift). Lower.
  7	8	9.7	010	0	# End: Draughting (digable) choke.

endcentreline
endsurvey

survey downstream

# End: Choke with ascending hole above. Small (passable?) streram rift below.

centreline
  # BCRA2
  sd length 0.5 metres
  sd compass clino 2.5 degrees
  calibrate compass 4.2
  data normal from to length compass clino
  1	2	8.9	030	0	# Walking streamway
  2	3	16.8	005	0
  3	4	1.9	085	0	# Hole in roof connects to "Ben's Link"
  4	5	2.8	015	0	# Entry climb
  5	6	8.0	010	0

endcentreline
endsurvey

survey upstream

